sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant UI as Vue 前端
    participant WS as FastAPI WebSocket
    participant S as VoiceSession
    participant ASR as Fun-ASR
    participant A as LangChain Agent
    participant T as 网络搜索/业务工具
    participant TTS as Qwen 双向 TTS

    U->>UI: 点击开始并授权麦克风
    UI->>WS: 建立 /ws/voice
    WS->>S: 创建会话并启动服务
    S-->>UI: session.ready / listening
    loop 约 100 ms 音频分片
        UI->>S: 16 kHz PCM16 二进制数据
        S->>ASR: send_audio_frame
        ASR-->>S: partial transcript
        S-->>UI: stt.partial
    end
    ASR-->>S: final transcript
    S-->>UI: stt.final / thinking
    S->>A: 用户文本 + thread.id
    opt Agent 判断需要实时信息
        A->>T: 调用 web_search
        T-->>A: 搜索摘要和来源链接
    end
    loop LLM 文本流
        A-->>S: agent.delta
        S-->>UI: 展示回答增量
        S->>TTS: append_text
        TTS-->>S: 24 kHz PCM16 音频分片
        S-->>UI: 二进制音频
        UI-->>U: 边接收边播放
    end
    S-->>UI: agent.finished / tts.finished
